{"product_id":"cherub-lone-wolf-book-16","title":"CHERUB: Lone Wolf: Book 16","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe sixteenth title in the number one bestselling CHERUB series!Fay has spent eighteen months locked up in a Secure Training Centre. Drug deals and rip-offs are the only things this teenager knows. Now she's back on the street, looking to settle old scores.CHERUB agents Ryan and Ning need Fay's knowledge to unearth a major drug importer. They're trained professionals with one essential advantage: even experienced criminals never suspect that children are spying on them.But Fay's made a lot of enemies and she's running out of time ...For official purposes, these children do not exist.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 197 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Robert Muchamore\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781444914115\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45447831814297,"sku":"12RD9781444914115","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68416b23e01a4-CHERUB-Lone-Wolf-Book-16-Robert-Muchamore-_1.jpg?v=1753121603","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/cherub-lone-wolf-book-16","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}